  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {実践|じっせん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to practice, to put into action)\n- {実践|じっせん}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{移|うつ}す→移す：10122_utsusu⟧ (to put into practice)\n- ⟦{実践的|じっせんてき}→実践的：05690_jissenteki⟧ (practical - adjective form)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{理論|りろん}→理論：04708_riron⟧ (theory) vs {実践|じっせん} (practice)\n- ⟦{学|まな}ぶ→学ぶ：01987_manabu⟧ (to learn) vs {実践|じっせん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to practice)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {実践|じっせん}⟦{経験|けいけん}→経験：01179_keiken⟧ (practical experience)\n- {実践|じっせん}⟦{知識|ちしき}→知識：01463_chishiki⟧ (practical knowledge)\n- {実践|じっせん}⟦{倫理|りんり}→倫理：05098_rinri⟧ (practical ethics)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{実行|じっこう}→実行：03274_jikkou⟧ (execution, carrying out)\n- ⟦{実施|じっし}→実施：03275_jisshi⟧ (implementation)\n- ⟦{応用|おうよう}→応用：04135_ouyou⟧ (application)",
